 Bank","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/british-business-bank","withdrawn":false}],"people":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/people/blair-mcdougall","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/people/blair-mcdougall","base_path":"/government/people/blair-mcdougall","content_id":"9a1fb1e7-7e96-4b76-9ca6-f9966211db61","document_type":"person","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-08-11T10:13:36Z","schema_name":"person","title":"Blair McDougall MP","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/people/blair-mcdougall","withdrawn":false}],"primary_publishing_organisation":[{"analytics_identifier":"D1382","api_path":"/api/content/government/organisations/department-for-business-and-trade","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/organisations/department-for-business-and-trade","base_path":"/government/organisations/department-for-business-and-trade","content_id":"aa750cdf-7925-429d-a2b3-0d9fa47d2c48","details":{"acronym":"DBT","brand":"department-for-business-trade","default_news_image":{"high_resolution_url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/64539946faf4aa0012e132d1/s960_DBT_Plaque-2.jpg","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/64539946c33b46000cf5e655/s300_DBT_Plaque-2.jpg"},"logo":{"crest":"dbt","formatted_title":"Department for<br/>Business &amp; Trade"},"organisation_govuk_status":{"status":"live","updated_at":null,"url":null}},"document_type":"organisation","links":{},"locale":"en","schema_name":"organisation","title":"Department for Business and Trade","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/department-for-business-and-trade","withdrawn":false}],"roles":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/ministers/parliamentary-under-secretary-of-state--292","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/ministers/parliamentary-under-secretary-of-state--292","base_path":"/government/ministers/parliamentary-under-secretary-of-state--292","content_id":"a6523e99-ec11-494f-8804-e92a735dfddc","details":{"body":"<p>His portfolio includes:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Industrial Strategy implementation</li>\n  <li>Industrial Strategy Council</li>\n  <li>entrepreneurs and small businesses</li>\n  <li>scale-ups</li>\n  <li>access to finance</li>\n  <li>cooperatives and non-financial mutuals</li>\n  <li>regulation</li>\n  <li>corporate governance</li>\n  <li>insolvency</li>\n  <li>Post Office</li>\n  <li>postal services</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Public bodies:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>British Business Bank  </li>\n  <li>Companies House  </li>\n  <li>The Insolvency Service  </li>\n  <li>Financial Reporting Council  </li>\n  <li>Regulatory Policy Committee  </li>\n  <li>Office of the Regulator of Community Interest Companies  </li>\n  <li>Small Business Commissioner   </li>\n  <li>Post Office</li>\n</ul>\n","role_payment_type":null,"seniority":100,"whip_organisation":{}},"document_type":"ministerial_role","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2025-11-13T14:58:36Z","schema_name":"role","title":"Parliamentary Under-Secretary of State (Minister for Small Business and Economic Transformation)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/ministers/parliamentary-under-secretary-of-state--292","withdrawn":false}],"taxons":[{"api_path":"/api/content/business-and-industry/business-and-the-environment","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/business-and-industry/business-and-the-environment","base_path":"/business-and-industry/business-and-the-environment","content_id":"13fb7519-c48e-4577-90f8-aaf483fa0c03","details":{"internal_name":"Business and the environment","notes_for_editors":"","visible_to_departmental_editors":false},"document_type":"taxon","links":{"parent_taxons":[{"api_path":"/api/content/business-and-industry","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/business-and-industry","base_path":"/business-and-industry","content_id":"495afdb6-47be-4df1-8b38-91c8adb1eefc","description":"","details":{"internal_name":"Business and industry","notes_for_editors":"","visible_